          "method": "POST",
          "postData": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "params": [],
            "text": "{\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3-Turbo\",\"task_type\":\"R2V\",\"prompt\":\"Real-life vertical smartphone video, filmed handheld by a friend on a\\nBangkok sidewalk during light afternoon rain. Natural daylight, real skin\\nand fabric texture, ordinary phone-camera look: no film grade, no CGI.\\n\\nThe man from the reference character sheet (short tousled light-brown\\nhair, olive-green crew-neck T-shirt, black shorts, black flip-flops)\\nstrolls toward the camera holding his open red umbrella high, looking\\npleased with himself. His flip-flop skids on a wet painted curb line and\\nhe does a classic silent-film prat fall: both feet fly up and he lands\\nflat on his back on the wet pavement. The red umbrella pops out of his\\nhand, bounces once and lands upside down beside him, filling with rain.\\nHe lies still for a beat, then lifts his head and gives the camera a\\ndeadpan look. He is unhurt.\\n\\nThe reference image is a turnaround sheet of one man: use it only for his\\nface, hair and outfit. Do not show the grid, the grey studio backdrop or\\nthe bicycle. Silent comedy: no dialogue, no speech, no music, no text or\\ncaptions. One continuous shot, no cuts.\",\"adapter\":\"hyperflow\",\"src_image_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/483c0b7bbed4232eeed9af3e2624a4d8b12b4ef2/tests/fixtures/charsheet.png\"],\"video_config\":{\"height\":768,\"duration_secs\":5,\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"audio\":false}}"
          },
          "queryString": [],
          "url": "https://api.machgen.ai/api/v0/generate"
        },
        "response": {
          "bodySize": 4146,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 4146,
            "text": "{\"output_images\":null,\"usage\":null,\"safety_identifier\":null,\"task_id\":\"31dda919-3dca-4bc0-807c-25117c2f4e28\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"Real-life vertical smartphone video, filmed handheld by a friend on a\\nBangkok sidewalk during light afternoon rain. Natural daylight, real skin\\nand fabric texture, ordinary phone-camera look: no film grade, no CGI.\\n\\nThe man from the reference character sheet (short tousled light-brown\\nhair, olive-green crew-neck T-shirt, black shorts, black flip-flops)\\nstrolls toward the camera holding his open red umbrella high, looking\\npleased with himself. His flip-flop skids on a wet painted curb line and\\nhe does a classic silent-film prat fall: both feet fly up and he lands\\nflat on his back on the wet pavement. The red umbrella pops out of his\\nhand, bounces once and lands upside down beside him, filling with rain.\\nHe lies still for a beat, then lifts his head and gives the camera a\\ndeadpan look. He is unhurt.\\n\\nThe reference image is a turnaround sheet of one man: use it only for his\\nface, hair and outfit. Do not show the grid, the grey studio backdrop or\\nthe bicycle. Silent comedy: no dialogue, no speech, no music, no text or\\ncaptions. One continuous shot, no cuts.\",\"model_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Subject 1> is the man whose face, short tousled light-brown hair, olive-green crew-neck T-shirt, black shorts, and black flip-flops are defined by <Picture 1>.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[reference generation] The target video is a vertical smartphone video filmed handheld on a Bangkok sidewalk during light afternoon rain, showing <Subject 1> strolling toward the camera with an open red umbrella, slipping on a wet curb line, falling flat on his back, and giving the camera a deadpan look from the pavement.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the man's face, short tousled light-brown hair, olive-green crew-neck T-shirt, black shorts, and black flip-flops from <Picture 1> are retained, omitting the grid, studio backdrop, and bicycle.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\nThe target video is a real-life vertical smartphone video, filmed handheld by a friend on a Bangkok sidewalk during light afternoon rain with natural daylight, real skin and fabric texture, and an ordinary phone-camera look with no film grade or CGI.\\n[Shot 1] The camera holds a handheld medium tracking shot, walking backward in front of <Subject 1> as he strolls forward along the wet concrete sidewalk toward the camera. <Subject 1> holds an open red umbrella high above his head with his right hand, looking pleased with himself. His black flip-flops strike a wet painted white curb line; his leading foot skids instantly. He performs a classic silent-film prat fall: both feet fly up into the air and he lands flat on his back on the wet pavement with a sudden thud. The red umbrella slips from his hand, bounces once on the concrete, and lands upside down beside him, catching the falling rain. <Subject 1> lies still flat on his back for a beat on the wet ground, then lifts his head and gives the camera a deadpan look while remaining unhurt.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nLight afternoon rain patters against the concrete sidewalk and the canopy of the red umbrella. A soft skid on wet paint is followed by a sudden thud as the man lands on the pavement, then the bounce of the umbrella and the steady sound of rain filling the upturned canopy.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":3617,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"high_motion\":null,\"optimization_level\":\"LOW\",\"optimization_level_adjusted_from\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3-MultiMax\",\"task_type\":\"R2V\",\"seed\":884177,\"fps\":null,\"height\":1344,\"width\":768,\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":5.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/483c0b7bbed4232eeed9af3e2624a4d8b12b4ef2/tes